                Private Demo
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- SECTION 1: HERO SECTION (Layout Family A: Interactive 3D Canvas + Split Typography) -->
    <section id="hero" class="relative min-h-screen pt-32 pb-20 px-6 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-gold/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono tracking-widest text-gold">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i>
                    SWEDISH CRAFTSMANSHIP SINCE 1941
                </div>

                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
                    Standard Tanpa Kompromi Dalam Fotografi <span class="font-italic text-gold italic">Medium Format</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
                    Presisi Skandinavia dan kualitas warna HNCS ikonik untuk mahakarya tak lekang waktu. Dirancang khusus bagi fotografer komersial dan kurator seni tinggi yang menuntut detail autentik tanpa manipulasi digital berlebih.
                </p>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4 pt-4">
                    <a href="#concierge" class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-gold hover:bg-amber-300 text-black font-semibold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-center transition-all shadow-xl shadow-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group">
                        Pesan Konsultasi Atelier
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#specs" class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white font-medium text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-center backdrop-blur-md transition-all">
                        Jelajahi Specs X2D
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-left">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-serif font-light text-white">100 MP</div>
                        <div class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">BSI CMOS Sensor</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-serif font-light text-white">16-Bit</div>
                        <div class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Kedalaman Warna</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-serif font-light text-white">15 Stop</div>
                        <div class="text-[11px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Dynamic Range</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3D Canvas Viewport Container -->
            <div id="medium-format" class="lg:col-span-7 h-[450px] sm:h-[550px] lg:h-[620px] w-full relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#141416] via-[#0B0B0C] to-black border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
                <div id="threeCanvas" class="w-full h-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing"></div>
                
                <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 md:left-6 md:right-auto bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-neutral-300 z-10 flex-wrap">
                    <button id="toggleWireframe" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes text-gold"></i>
                        <span>Rangka 3D</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="toggleRotation" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate text-gold"></i>
                        <span>Jeda Rotasi</span>
                    </button>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest ml-auto font-mono hidden lg:inline">
                        Interactive Three.js Engine
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: COLOR ARCHITECTURE (Layout Family B: Asymmetric Metric Cards + Interactive Spectrum Engine) -->
    <section id="colour" class="py-28 px-6 bg-[#141416]/60 border-y border-white/5 relative">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
            <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold font-mono">Architecture of Color & Light</h2>
                <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white">
                    Hasselblad Natural Colour Solution (HNCS)
                </h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Fotografi sejati tidak memerlukan filter berlebihan. Algoritma HNCS memproses 64 miliar variasi warna langsung dari sensor medium format untuk merekam kontinuitas spektrum nada kulit dan lanskap alam secara persis sesuai penglihatan mata manusia.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-[#0B0B0C] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Simulasi Komparasi Warna Sensor</span>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-white">16-bit HNCS Medium Format vs 8-bit Standard sRGB</h4>
                    </div>
                    <span id="spectrumStatus" class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-neutral-300 text-xs font-mono">
                        Mode Terpilih: Dynamic HNCS Spectrum
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="relative h-72 sm:h-96 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group select-none">
                    <!-- Base 8-bit Background -->
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Standard 8bit" class="w-full h-full object-cover filter contrast-125 saturate-75 brightness-90">
                        <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-300 border border-white/10">
                            Standard 8-bit sRGB
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Overlay 16-bit HNCS Clip Container -->
                    <div id="hncsOverlay" class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 bg-black overflow-hidden border-r-2 border-gold" style="width: 50%;">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=95" alt="Hasselblad 16bit" class="w-full h-full object-cover max-w-none" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;">
                        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-gold text-black font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono shadow-lg">
                            Hasselblad 16-bit HNCS
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">
                        <span>0% Standard Digital Compressed</span>
                        <span>50% Mid Spectrum</span>
                        <span>100% Full 16-Bit Dynamic HNCS</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" id="colorRange" min="0" max="100" value="50" class="w-full h-2 bg-neutral-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-gold">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-[#0B0B0C] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-gold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-white">Sensor BSI 100 Megapixel</h4>
                    <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Sensor backlight illuminated memperluas penyerapan cahaya hingga sudut piksel terkecil, menghasilkan kejernihan mikro pada serat kain, tekstur kulit, dan arsitektur.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#0B0B0C] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-gold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-white">15 Stop Rentang Dinamis</h4>
                    <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Transisi dari sorotan sinar matahari yang terang menuju bayangan paling dalam terekam sempurna tanpa gradasi terputus atau area terpotong.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#0B0B0C] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-gold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-white">Profil Warna Autentik</h4>
                    <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Tidak ada preset warna buatan. HNCS memberikan kepastian bahwa warna sampel produk komersial atau karya galeri terekam presisi 100 persen.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: SCANDINAVIAN CRAFTSMANSHIP (Layout Family C: Interactive Exploded View & Hotspots) -->
    <section id="precision" class="py-28 px-6 bg-[#0B0B0C] relative">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6">
                <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4">
                    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold font-mono">Scandinavian Precision Engineering</h2>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white">
                        Setiap Komponen Difrais Presisi di Göteborg, Swedia
                    </h3>
                </div>
                <button id="toggleExplodeBtn" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white text-xs uppercase font-semibold tracking-wider transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-up-down-left-right text-gold"></i>
                    <span id="explodeBtnText">Urai Komponen Optik 3D</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 h-[420px] sm:h-[480px] relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-950 p-6 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <!-- Conceptual Visual Render of Camera Body and Leaf Shutter -->
                    <div class="relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center">
                        <div id="hotspotChassis" class="w-64 h-44 rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 border-2 border-neutral-700 shadow-2xl relative flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-700">
                            <!-- Lens Assembly Container -->
                            <div id="hotspotLens" class="w-36 h-36 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-neutral-800 to-black border-4 border-gold/60 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative transition-all duration-700">
                                <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-blue-900/40 border-2 border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Hotspot Pins -->
                        <button onclick="showHotspot('sensor')" class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 p-3 rounded-full bg-gold text-black font-bold animate-bounce hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-gold/50 text-xs">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="showHotspot('chassis')" class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/4 p-3 rounded-full bg-gold text-black font-bold animate-bounce hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-gold/50 text-xs">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="showHotspot('shutter')" class="absolute top-1/2 right-1/4 p-3 rounded-full bg-gold text-black font-bold animate-bounce hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-gold/50 text-xs">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
                    <div id="hotspotCard" class="bg-[#141416] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4 transition-all">
                        <span id="hotspotTag" class="text-xs font-mono text-gold uppercase tracking-wider">Detail Keteknikan</span>
                        <h4 id="hotspotTitle" class="text-2xl font-serif text-white">Filosofi Keahlian Tangan Skandinavia</h4>
                        <p id="hotspotDesc" class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Setiap kamera Hasselblad X2D 100C diproduksi secara individu oleh teknisi berpengalaman. Permukaan bodi dilapisi dengan perlakuan khusus anodized graphite yang tahan terhadap cuaca ekstrem dan gesekan tinggi saat pengambilan gambar di lapangan.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: CURATED MASTERPIECE GALLERY (Layout Family D: Full-Bleed Masonry Lightbox Grid) -->
    <section id="mastery" class="py-28 px-6 bg-[#141416]/40 border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6">
                <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4">
                    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold font-mono">Curated Fine Art Collection</h2>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white">
                        Galeri Mahakarya Fotografer Dunia
                    </h3>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">
                    Klik gambar untuk membuka inspeksi resolusi tinggi
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div onclick="openLightbox('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'Solitude in Nordland', 'Sven Lindqvist', 'Landscape Dynamic')" class="group relative h-[400px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 cursor-pointer bg-neutral-900">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Nordland" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-95 transition-opacity"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-8 space-y-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold/20 border border-gold/40 text-gold text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Landscape Dynamic</span>
                        <h4 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white">Solitude in Nordland</h4>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-neutral-400 pt-2 border-t border-white/10 font-mono">
                            <span>Fotografer: Sven Lindqvist</span>
                            <span class="text-gold">15.2 Dynamic Stops</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div onclick="openLightbox('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85', 'Portrait of High Fashion', 'Elena Rostova', 'Studio Skin Tone')" class="group relative h-[400px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 cursor-pointer bg-neutral-900">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Fashion" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/20 to-transparent opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-95 transition-opacity"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-8 space-y-2">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold/20 border border-gold/40 text-gold text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Studio Skin Tone</span>
                        <h4 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white">Portrait of High Fashion</h4>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-neutral-400 pt-2 border-t border-white/10 font-mono">
                            <span>Fotografer: Elena Rostova</span>
                            <span class="text-gold">16-bit Natural HNCS</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LIGHTBOX MODAL CONTAINER -->
    <div id="lightbox" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/95 backdrop-blur-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-6">
        <div class="max-w-5xl w-full bg-[#141416] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative space-y-6 p-6 sm:p-8">
            <button onclick="closeLightbox()" class="absolute top-6 right-6 p-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="h-[450px] w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-black">
                <img id="lightboxImg" src="" alt="Zoom" class="w-full h-full object-contain">
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 id="lightboxTitle" class="text-2xl font-serif text-white">Title</h4>
                <p id="lightboxArtist" class="text-xs text-neutral-400 font-mono mt-1">Artist</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 5: TECHNICAL MATRIX (Layout Family E: Interactive Data Matrix Table) -->
    <section id="specs" class="py-28 px-6 bg-[#0B0B0C] border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold font-mono">System Architecture</h2>
                <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white">
                    Spesifikasi Teknis Kamera Hasselblad X2D 100C
                </h3>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
                <button onclick="switchSpecTab('studio')" id="tab-studio" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono bg-gold text-black font-bold">
                    Studio Master
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchSpecTab('landscape')" id="tab-landscape" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono bg-white/5 text-neutral-400 hover:text-white">
                    Field Landscape
                </button>
